Changes in this fork (summary):
- managed-hosting features of the original removed (diagnostics tools, snapshot hook,
  Docker/registry files)
- read-only by default; per-call timeouts; API path normalisation (/api/x == /x)
- status-aware raw responses, NDJSON parsing (DELETE /api/cache), multipart uploads
- actor verification (a rejected token silently acts as a guest in Flarum 2)
- admin tools: settings get/set/reset, image upload/delete, cache clear,
  extension toggle, permission set, health
- design-set engine: snapshot / validate / diff / apply / preview / rollback / gallery
- CLI (flarum2-ops) sharing the same engine
- MCP tool annotations; corrected 2.0-stable help texts
